{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>2025</strong>, COVID-19 <strong>mutated into something unstoppable</strong>\u2014<strong>Zovid</strong>. The world didn\u2019t stand a chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The vaccinated survived. The unvaccinated didn\u2019t.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They became something <strong>beyond human\u2014rabid, relentless, unkillable.</strong> Nations burned <strong>in hours</strong>, civilization was <strong>erased overnight</strong>, and the last remnants of humanity were <strong>left to rot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, in <strong>2027</strong>, the world is just a hunting ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No cure. No salvation. <strong>No one is coming to save you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only rule left: <strong>Kill or be killed.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Unforgiving Survival</strong> \u2013 <strong>Hunger. Thirst. Infection.</strong> You\u2019re always dying\u2014slowly or violently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Guns Won\u2019t Save You</strong> \u2013 Pistol, rifle, shotgun\u2014<strong>it doesn\u2019t matter.</strong> You\u2019ll run out of ammo long before you run out of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>The World Hates You</strong> \u2013 Cities are <strong>infested</strong>, ruins are <strong>traps</strong>, and the few survivors left <strong>will slit your throat for a can of food.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>The Past is Dead</strong> \u2013 Scour through <strong>leftover notes, forgotten radio transmissions, and bloodstained walls</strong> to learn how the world ended\u2014<strong>not that it matters anymore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Arena Mode \u2013 You Will Die Here</strong> \u2013 Endless waves. No mercy. <strong>See how long you last before your body joins the pile.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This World is Hell.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No hope. No future. No escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t <strong>win</strong> in Zovid27. You <strong>survive\u2014until you don\u2019t.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Step in\u2026 if you dare.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/debb56a8ca031b0700e50705e04b03a1b97eb174.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/e05a0bac1af61b6744f8d6030eb3be56ba0997ef.jpg"},{"name":"Grave Walker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/d0cbf9e190d12df222dbcbf51c60aec713c0c05d.jpg"},{"name":"Thousand Tears","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/39f6a30691bbe71d4d395038dda2eb7fd454b0a6.jpg"},{"name":"First Payday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/ee8ce426ed4aa179f8895eb83bc6835c346249a7.jpg"},{"name":"Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/37524d0499bad9df201b0fbbb3f991581a2e2db9.jpg"},{"name":"Big Spender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/81cfc840771ab132fc298ed6d8f1bc2d55476635.jpg"},{"name":"Merchant King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/d651668560fab4b48a0cddae0333d3c29aacdd59.jpg"},{"name":"Headstart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/5fce5031593c344f1136f486f1527274c4573da4.jpg"},{"name":"Skull Trader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463560/f342b0607c05497d917714532a6c907957436d2a.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463560?t=1740775925","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3463560?t=1740775925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463560/603658d371b7f3b50fc2c6a3a06598c853224093/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740775925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463560/603658d371b7f3b50fc2c6a3a06598c853224093/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740775925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Intense Violence and Gore: Combat against zombies and hostile human factions involves firearms, melee weapons, and close-quarters combat. Blood, dismemberment, and graphic death scenes are present.\r\nHorror and Psychological Tension: The game features a dark and eerie atmosphere designed to create a tense survival experience.\r\nDrug and Alcohol Use: Alcohol and certain substances can be found in the game world, and some characters may use them.\r\nSuicide and Self-Harm Themes: The story may depict characters struggling with despair, leading to themes of suicide or self-inflicted harm.\r\nSocietal Collapse and Human Rights Violations: The game explores the breakdown of society, including instances of brutality, forced labor, and violence.\r\nSexual Content: There are no explicit sexual scenes in the game. However, mature themes related to relationships and past events may be referenced through environmental storytelling."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>2025</strong>, COVID-19 <strong>mutated into something unstoppable</strong>\u2014<strong>Zovid</strong>. The world didn\u2019t stand a chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The vaccinated survived. The unvaccinated didn\u2019t.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They became something <strong>beyond human\u2014rabid, relentless, unkillable.</strong> Nations burned <strong>in hours</strong>, civilization was <strong>erased overnight</strong>, and the last remnants of humanity were <strong>left to rot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, in <strong>2027</strong>, the world is just a hunting ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No cure. No salvation. <strong>No one is coming to save you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only rule left: <strong>Kill or be killed.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Unforgiving Survival</strong> \u2013 <strong>Hunger. Thirst. Infection.</strong> You\u2019re always dying\u2014slowly or violently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Guns Won\u2019t Save You</strong> \u2013 Pistol, rifle, shotgun\u2014<strong>it doesn\u2019t matter.</strong> You\u2019ll run out of ammo long before you run out of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>The World Hates You</strong> \u2013 Cities are <strong>infested</strong>, ruins are <strong>traps</strong>, and the few survivors left <strong>will slit your throat for a can of food.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>The Past is Dead</strong> \u2013 Scour through <strong>leftover notes, forgotten radio transmissions, and bloodstained walls</strong> to learn how the world ended\u2014<strong>not that it matters anymore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Arena Mode \u2013 You Will Die Here</strong> \u2013 Endless waves. No mercy. <strong>See how long you last before your body joins the pile.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This World is Hell.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No hope. No future. No escape.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t <strong>win</strong> in Zovid27. You <strong>survive\u2014until you don\u2019t.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Step in\u2026 if you dare.</strong></p>","developers":["Lupora Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463560/header.jpg?t=1740775925","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257092320,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092320/movie480.mp4?t=1738660860","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092320/movie_max.mp4?t=1738660860"},"name":"Zovid27: The Last Vaccine","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257092320/1c5b36696dc31a349970f749e4681a0cf930b5cc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738660860","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092320/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738660860","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257092320/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738660860"}}],"name":"Zovid27: The Last Vaccine","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Zovid27: The Last Vaccine - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$15.99</span> $14.39 USD","packageid":1223678,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","price_in_cents_with_discount"